# @hub-lanes
# Merge conductor wake consumer (BH-6975): every minute, read the pr and checks
# wakes above this lane's own cursor and start ONE keyed conductor tick
# (MC_ONLY_PR) per woken harness PR, at most MC_WAKE_BUDGET a minute, so a PR or
# check event is acted on within a minute. The 5-minute backstop (411) and the
# 30-minute full tick (410) stay. Off: bin/harness-ctl.sh off merge-conductor-wake.
* * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/merge-conductor-wake.sh >> /root/harness/logs/merge-conductor-wake-cron.log 2>&1
